Rips_SeizeReferrerFee
├── when the caller is not the owner
│   └── it should revert.
├── when the referrer is the zero address
│   └── it should revert.
├── when there is no accrued fee for the referrer and currency
│   └── it should revert.
└── when there is accrued fee for the referrer and currency
    ├── it should reset the accrued fee to zero.
    ├── it should transfer the fee to the fee recipient.
    └── it should emit a {ReferrerFeeSeized} event.
